    "body": "> > Will JSON modules be the first time that the JSON MIME type is actually checked in running an HTML page?\r\n\r\nNavigation (https://html.spec.whatwg.org/C/#process-a-navigate-response, see https://github.com/whatwg/mimesniff/issues/112#issue-519846712) also checks JSON MIME type, but I'm not sure about its importance.\r\n",
